; ── Iter 188 batch 3 — cursed ritual well details ────────────────────
; User direction: "Rework central hazard into a cursed ritual font/well
; with stone rim, cracks, subtle green seepage." The iter-186 batch 2
; rim + runes gave the basin architectural identity; this commit adds
; the AGE + CORRUPTION reading:
;
;   1. RimCrackNE/SE/SW/NW — 4 short Line2D fractures radiating outward
;      from the rim at 45° intervals (between the cardinal runes).
;      Suggests stone aging — the carved basin has fractured under
;      centuries of cursed magic.
;   2. SeepA/B/C — 3 small dark green Polygon2D stains OUTSIDE the
;      basin perimeter. Reads as toxic liquid leaching past the rim,
;      contaminating the surrounding floor. Asymmetric placement so
;      it feels organic, not symmetric.

