; Iter 189 batch 2 — toxic light emission. The cursed well becomes
; an actual LIGHT SOURCE in the room: pillars near it cast greenish
; shadows, walls catch the toxic glow, hero standing close visually
; INTERACTS with the hazard's emission. Energy kept low (0.45) so it
; doesn't compete with torches; range_z_max negative keeps it on the
; floor plane.
